<title>JAPAN: Ibiden rises, helped by recent upgradings.</title>
<headline>Ibiden rises, helped by recent upgradings.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Ibiden Co Ltd continued to jump on Thursday, marking a new high for 1996, supported by the recent upgradings of the stock by securities houses, traders said.</p>
<p>At 0103 GMT, the share price of the electrical machinery maker was up 30 yen at 1,150 yen, after reaching a new high of 1,160. Turnover was 1.091 million shares.</p>
<p>Traders said buying by speculative investors accelerated the rise.</p>
